  "id": 40,
  "Specification": "EnvironmentController: An environment controller for a failure-detector system combining an Age_Channel communication channel and an EPFailureDetector. Models N processes with up to T crash failures, per-process clocks, outgoing messages, and pause counters. Actions: Crash (fail a process), EnvTick (advance message ages and reset move flags), ProcTick (per-process predict/send/receive steps). Constraints DELTAConstraint and PHIConstraint bound message ages and process pause intervals. Properties: StrongCompleteness and EventuallyStrongAccuracy.",
